     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline!important;float:none\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline!important;float:none\">Hi,</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">I&#39;ve made a simple example for fitting the LGCP</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">log(lambda(s)) = beta_0 + w(s)</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">with w(s) a GRF with Matern covariance function.</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">Even if I fit the LGCP model using both INLA and inlabru R-packages using the same prior specification for w(s), I get very different results. See the attached figure (black line - posterior with INLA ; red line - posterior with inlabru; blue line - true value)</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/attach/67c4c641ce929/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%201?part=0.4&amp;view=1\" alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px\" width=\"400\" height=\"173\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">Is there any reason for these differences? I&#39;m quite new using inlabru and perhaps I&#39;ve made a mistake in my code (see attachments). Any help is really appreciated.</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">Best,</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(2